```

You can use tools like Burp Suite or Postman to intercept the AJAX request and send it to your Python server.

### 2. **Using WebSockets**

Some widgets might use WebSockets to send data in real-time. You can set up a WebSocket server to receive data from the widget.

**Example:**

```javascript
