为了实现基于Socket通信的电商客服系统，我们需要设计一个客户端和一个服务器端。客户端负责与客服端建立连接，发送文字、图片和文件，并处理客服端长时间未响应的情况。服务器端则负责处理多个用户的连接请求，发送文字、文件和图片，并保存聊天记录。

### 1. 服务器端设计

服务器端需要能够处理多个客户端连接，并支持文字、文件和图片的传输。此外，还需要保存聊天记录。

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.*;
import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap;
import java.util.concurrent.ExecutorService;
import java.util.concurrent.Executors;

public class CustomerServiceServer {
    private ServerSocket serverSocket;
    private ExecutorService executorService;
    private ConcurrentHashMap<String, Socket> clientSockets;

    public CustomerServiceServer(int port) throws IOException {
        serverSocket = new ServerSocket(port);
        executorService = Executors.newCachedThreadPool();
        clientSockets = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();
    }

    public void start() {
        while (true) {
            try {
                Socket clientSocket = serverSocket.accept();
                executorService.execute(new ClientHandler(clientSocket));
            } catch (IOException e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            }
        }
    }

    private class ClientHandler implements Runnable {
        private Socket socket;

        public ClientHandler(Socket socket) {
            this.socket = socket;
        }

        @Override
        public void run() {
            try (DataInputStream in = new DataInputStream(socket.getInputStream());
                 DataOutputStream out = new DataOutputStream(socket.getOutputStream())) {

                String clientId = socket.getInetAddress().getHostAddress();
                System.out.println("New client connected: " + clientId);

                while (true) {
                    String message = in.readUTF();
                    if (message.startsWith("disconnect")) {
                        System.out.println("Client disconnected: " + clientId);
                        clientSockets.remove(clientId);
                        break;
                    }

                    // Handle message
                    handleMessage(message, out);
                }
            } catch (IOException e) {
                e.printStackTrace();
            } finally {
                try {
                    socket.close();
                } catch (IOException e) {
                    e.printStackTrace();
                }
            }
        }

        private void handleMessage(String message, DataOutputStream out) throws IOException {
            if (message.startsWith("text")) {
                String content = message.substring(5);
                out.writeUTF("text received: " + content);
            } else if (message.startsWith("image")) {
                // Handle image transmission
                out.writeUTF("image received");
            } else if (message.startsWith("file")) {
                // Handle file transmission
                out.writeUTF("file received");
            }
        }
    }

    public void stop() {
        try {
            serverSocket.close();
        } catch (IOException e) {
            e.printStackTrace();
        }
        executorService.shutdown();
    }
}
```

