# Radiology Resident Quiz Platform

This example demonstrates a secure and interactive quiz generation platform tailored for radiology residents, integrating a frontend HTML form with a Node.js backend to leverage OpenAI's GPT-3 for question generation.

## Frontend (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)

**index.html:**

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Radiology Resident Quiz Platform</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Generate Your Quiz</h1>
    <form id="quizForm">
        <label for="board">Board:</label>
        <select id="board" required>
            <option value="">Select Board</option>
            <option value="US">Ultrasound</option>
            <option value="CT">CT</option>
            <option value="MRI">MRI</option>
            <!-- Add more boards as needed -->
        </select>

        <label for="questionType">Question Type:</label>
        <select id="questionType" required>
            <option value="">Select Type</option>
            <option value="multipleChoice">Multiple Choice</option>
            <option value="trueFalse">True/False</option>
            <!-- Add more question types -->
        </select>

        <label for="difficulty">Difficulty Level:</label>
        <select id="difficulty" required>
            <option value="">Select Difficulty</option>
            <option value="easy">Easy</option>
            <option value="medium">Medium</option>
            <option value="hard">Hard</option>
        </select>

        <label for="numQuestions">Number of Questions:</label>
        <input type="number" id="numQuestions" min="1" max="10" required>

        <label for="customText">Additional Text (up to 500 words):</label>
        <textarea id="customText" rows="4" cols="50" placeholder="Enter any specific content or context..."></textarea>

        <button type="button" onclick="generateQuiz()">Generate Quiz</button>
